<Base lang="en" title="Caldrew | An acquisition and operating company in Lisbon" description="Caldrew acquires and builds Iberian companies over long horizons. Operator-led, based in Lisbon." ogTitle="Caldrew" ogDescription="Caldrew is an acquisition and operating company based in Lisbon, led by operators.">
<section class="cd-section"><div class="cd-container"><p class="cd-eyebrow">An acquisition and operating company</p><h1 class="cd-hero-title">We buy and build Iberian companies for the long term.</h1><p class="cd-lede">Caldrew is an investor based in Lisbon, led by operators. We acquire established businesses and stay to build them.</p><a href="/approach" class="cd-cta">Our approach</a></div></section><div><section class="cd-section-tight"><div class="cd-container"><div class="cd-grid"><div class="cd-card"><h2 class="cd-card-title">Operators, not financiers</h2><p class="cd-body">Our partners have run, turned around and sold companies themselves. We make decisions the way owners do, because we have been owners.</p></div><div class="cd-card"><h2 class="cd-card-title">Long horizons</h2><p class="cd-body">We buy to build. Good companies become leaders over years, and we hold for as long as that work takes.</p></div><div class="cd-card"><h2 class="cd-card-title">Growth by consolidation</h2><p class="cd-body">We acquire platform companies in fragmented sectors and build around them, acquisition by acquisition. Scale is earned through discipline, not financial engineering.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="cd-section-ink"><div class="cd-container"><p class="cd-eyebrow-light">Who we partner with</p><h2 class="cd-band-title">Founders and families at a turning point.</h2><p class="cd-band-body">Succession without an obvious successor. A transition that deserves a careful owner. A partner for the next phase of growth. These are the conversations we are built for.</p></div></section><section class="cd-closing"><div class="cd-container"><p class="cd-closing-line">If that sounds like your situation, we should talk.</p><a href="/contact" class="cd-cta-tight">Get in touch</a></div></section></div>
</Base>
